    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Transit Insurance:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">To safeguard against unforeseen circumstances like accidents or delays, opt for comprehensive transit insurance covering 100% of the assessed value of your belongings. This ensures that in case of any damage or loss, you are adequately compensated.</p>
  </div>
</div>
	
